# Advisories cpan-audit should not fail on, one id per line. Each entry says
# either "Does not apply", with why Netdisco is not affected, or "No fix to
# require", where no release fixes it. Remove an entry once a fixed release
# exists and Build.PL requires it.

# Does not apply: predictable session ids. Netdisco uses Dancer's cookie
# sessions, where the cookie carries the session encrypted and signed with
# the site's random key, so a guessed id cannot be used to forge a session.
CPANSA-Dancer-2026-5080

# Does not apply: shell metacharacters in host names. PingSweep only pings
# addresses it generates from the IP prefix it is given.
CPANSA-Net-Ping-External-2008-7319

# Does not apply: Plack::Middleware::XSendfile, which Netdisco does not use.
# The database also marks every Plack version, but the advisory names 1.0053
# and earlier, and Build.PL requires 1.0057.
CPANSA-Plack-2026-7381

# Does not apply: plain HTTP downloads. The database marks every version, but
# the advisory names 1.7047 and earlier, and Build.PL requires 1.7049.
CPANSA-App-cpanminus-2024-45321

# Does not apply: symlink checks in File::Temp's MEDIUM and HIGH safe levels.
# Netdisco uses the default level, which does not run them.
CPANSA-File-Temp-2011-4116

# No fix to require: the advisory is LemonLDAP::NG relying on Net::LDAPS's
# default certificate checking, and no Net::LDAP release changes it.
CPANSA-Net-LDAPS-2020-16093

# Does not apply: DBD::Pg 3.21.0 only, through quoting NaN or Infinity as a
# number. Netdisco quotes only strings. Requiring 3.21.1 would rebuild the OS
# package's DBD::Pg from source, which needs the PostgreSQL client headers.
CPANSA-DBD-Pg-2026-78183

# Does not apply: an infinite loop decompressing crafted data. Netdisco
# decodes Sereal only inside session cookies, after Session::Storage::Secure
# has checked their signature.
CPANSA-Sereal-Decoder-2018-12913-miniz
CPANSA-Sereal-Encoder-2018-12913-miniz

# Does not apply: comparing strings of different lengths leaks the length.
# Session::Storage::Secure compares fixed-length signatures, whose length is
# public.
CPANSA-String-Compare-ConstantTime-2024-13939
